            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "J. Pregnant employees who work in conditions/situations deemed hazardous or dangerous to the pregnancy by the atten ding physician may make a written request to the appointing authority for a temporary reassignment within their job description or a comparable position, and may be reassigned within two (2) weeks of notification for the duration of the pregnancy. Upon req uest by management, the employee will provide medical evidence.",
