        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "L. Except for emergency situations, the person in charge shall make reasonable efforts to rearrange assignments for employees whose workweek consists of thirty-seven and one half (37 1/2) hours or more, to avoid unreasonable exposure to the extremes of weather, when the outside temperature drops to a low of ten (10) degrees Fahrenheit, or zero (0) degrees Fahrenheit with the wind chill factor.",
